{
  "title": "Isekai Oooku de JK wa Koi o Suru",
  "description": "16-year-old Himeno Shion has never experienced love. Unfortunately, her opportunity to do so in this world unexpectedly comes to an end when she's hit by a truck and dies.\n\n“Do you want to fall in love?”\n\nSuddenly, she's in another world… and about to be eaten by a dragon! In the nick of time, she's saved by the Hero. And he's handsome! Is this it‽ Is this the love she's been searching for‽\n\nAfter being brought to the Hero's castle, Shion discovers that her romantic desires are not aligned with the Hero's. He has a harem of girls from many different races! A lamia! A centaur!\n\nWill Shion still be able to achieve the love of her dreams‽",
  "artist": "Ooi Masakazu",
  "author": "Ooi Masakazu",
